## 3. Understand the Wazuh FIM Workflow

```text
Linux Endpoint
      ↓
Wazuh Agent
      ↓
File Integrity Monitoring
      ↓
File Change Event
      ↓
Wazuh Server and Rules
      ↓
Alert / Event
      ↓
Wazuh Dashboard
      ↓
SOC Investigation
```

Wazuh FIM is implemented by its `syscheck` component. It can monitor configured directories and report changes according to its settings.

**Important:** A detected file change does not automatically mean an attack occurred. Software updates, administrator activity, and normal application operations can also change files.

